category: Libs
build-depends: cygport perl
sdesc: "Terminfo parsing library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Unibilium is a very basic terminfo library. It doesn't depend on curses or
any other library. It also doesn't use global variables, so it should be
thread-safe."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/neovim/unibilium
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
